              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USihoni akamvumelanga u-Israyeli ukuba adabule emkhawulweni wakhe, kepha uSihoni wabutha bonke abantu bakhe, waphuma ukulwa no-Israyeli ehlane; wafika eJahazi walwa no-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
