              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Base bephenduka bakhuphuka ngendlela yaseBashani, u-Ogi inkosi yaseBashani waphuma ukulwa nabo, yena nabo bonke abantu bakhe, ekulweni e-Edireyi.",
