              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova wayesethi kuMose: “Ungamesabi, ngokuba ngimnikele esandleni sakho yena nabantu bakhe bonke nezwe lakhe; uyakwenza kuye njengoba wenza kuSihoni, inkosi yama-Amori, owayehlala eHeshiboni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
